NOTE ON THIS BUILD

client/js/vendor/perfect-freehand.umd.js in this repository is a self-contained,
dependency-free UMD build that faithfully re-implements the perfect-freehand
algorithm and exposes the same public API (getStroke / getStrokePoints /
getStrokeOutlinePoints). It was authored for an offline environment where the
upstream npm package / CDN bundle was unavailable to inline directly. It is
distributed under the same MIT terms shown above, with attribution to the
original author, Stephen Ruiz.
